      "content": "If you are feeling like you want to end your life, please know that there are people who want to support you right now. You can connect with compassionate, trained individuals by calling or texting 988 in the United States and Canada to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7 to listen without judgment. Please reach out to them immediately; they can help you through this critical moment.",
